OL,3,GNEWSAStolen Feathers McGraw topper
OL,4,Afound in 'plain sight'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stolen Wallace and Gromit-themed
OL,7,Fpostbox topper in the shape of Feathers
OL,8,FMcGraw has been returned to the scene
OL,9,Fof the crime.
OL,11,FA knitted version of the silent yet
OL,12,Fvillainous penguin, who first appeared
OL,13,Fin the short film The Wrong Trousers,
OL,14,Fhad been created by Debbie Williamson
OL,15,Ffrom Mansfield in Nottinghamshire.
OL,17,FHe brightened up a postbox in Clipstone
OL,18,FRoad West, Forest Town, before he went
OL,19,Fmissing two weeks ago.
